      "worked": "A negative product is less than any positive product, so choose one negative and one positive number. The greatest available magnitudes of opposite signs are $8$ and $4$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}(-8)\\times4&=-(8\\times4)\\\\(-8)\\times4&=-32\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe least product is $-32$.",
